# va2000: its .moddata keys and the definition line, as the Amix ABI kit's
# mkmod reads a Master (the kit's docs/guide.md, section 3).  One Master for
# both kernel lines: no $cpu, the kit gives the line's (68030 or 68040).
# Demand class: the module core loads it at the first open of /dev/va2000.
$modtype drv
$class demand
$majors c:68
$unload never
$desc MNT VA2000 RTG framebuffer
va2000	va2000
